spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">어플리케이션</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">의 핵심 기능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">소비자 역할</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">① </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">어플리케이션을 시행한 후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">GPS</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 기반으로 지역설정을 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">② </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">비교 견적 시작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">]</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">을 누르고 시공항목을 선택한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">③ </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">시공을 원하는 장소 사진을 원거리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">근거리로 촬영한 뒤 구체적인 요구사항 및  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">설명을 적는다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. - </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">주변 구조에 따라 견적이 달라질 수 있으므로 원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">근거리 사진이 모두 요구된다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">④ </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">여러 업체의 견적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">업체 역할</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">②</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">을 비교하며 자신에게 알맞은 업체를 선택한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">업체 역할</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">① </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">어플리케이션에 해당 지역의 인테리어 업체와 각 항목을 시공하는 업체가    </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">나열된다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">② </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">비교 견적 요청이 들어오면</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">소비자 역할</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">③</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">해당 업체들은 소비자가 요구한 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">요청에 대해 어떤 제품과 재료를 사용할 것인지 가격 측면과 충분한 설명을 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-size:12.0pt;\">적어 소비자에게 전달한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 10pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><img src=\"https://qubiton.xyz/upload/festival/u300_festival_editor(7394).JPG\" style=\"width: 840px;\"><img src=\"https://qubiton.xyz/upload/festival/u300_festival_editor(7395).JPG\" style=\"width: 840px;\"><img src=\"https://qubiton.xyz/upload/festival/u300_festival_editor(7396).JPG\" style=\"width: 840px;\"><img src=\"https://qubiton.xyz/upload/festival/u300_festival_editor(7397).JPG\" style=